    "Search keywords: Keep Screen On" : {
      "comment" : "Settings search keywords for Keep Screen On, separated by commas. Not shown on screen: list the words people in your language would type to keep the screen from locking or sleeping. Auto-Lock is the name of the iOS setting: use its name in the language's iOS.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
