      "comment" : "VoiceOver label of a Show Value button in the photo details. The placeholder is the row's title, such as Location.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Slow burst: up to %lld a second" : {
      "comment" : "Burst card on the camera, before a burst: the speed in use. The number is the most photos a second, 2; it can be fewer.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Start Burst" : {
      "comment" : "Button on the burst card, VoiceOver action on the shutter and Voice Control name: starts a burst that runs without holding the shutter.",
