    },
    "The keyboard and menus are drawn by iOS and are not red." : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility screen, Night Mode: the system keyboard, which opens for search, and system menus keep the dark appearance; nope. can't draw them in red. Draft wording for the Honesty review (issue #88).",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "This Frame" : {
