    "Split: %@ nope., %@ phone processing" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver value of the compare view's divider: how much of the width shows nope.'s photo and how much the phone-processed version, such as 60% and 40%. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. On iPad the English names the iPad, and on other devices it says \"device\"; translate each variant. Draft for the Honesty review.",
